{"timestamp": 1779396478.01295, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I just found Charlie's body in weapons! Bob was literally right in the room standing next to the body when I walked in. \n\nTo give you all my full route for tracking: I started in medbay, went to upper engine (where I saw Eve and Frank), moved to oxygen (saw Frank there again), passed through the cafeteria, and then headed into weapons where I found the scene. \n\nBob, you have some serious explaining to do. You were right there with Charlie's body. Did you just kill him? Unless you have a bulletproof explanation, this looks incredibly suspicious."}}
{"timestamp": 1779396488.544894, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I can confirm Alice's route completely. I was in upper engine and oxygen, and I saw both Alice and Frank there just like she said. \n\nAs for the murder, I was actually making my way through the cafeteria to weapons near the end of the round. Right around tick 13, I saw Bob enter weapons from the cafeteria, and Charlie was in there too. If Alice walked in right after that and found Charlie dead with Bob standing there... that looks really, really bad for Bob. \n\nBob, I literally saw you walk into the room where Charlie died right before this meeting was called. I'm definitely leaning towards voting you, but let's hear what you have to say for yourself. Frank, can you confirm the oxygen/upper engine part of our route too?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779396505.3920681, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Okay everyone, let me be straight with you because this looks bad and I know it.\n\nYes, I was in weapons. But I did not kill Charlie. Here's my full route: I started in cafeteria, went to medbay, then electrical, back to medbay, back through cafeteria, and into weapons. I was faking \u2014 I mean, I was checking on the weapons task panel.\n\nNow here's the thing that doesn't add up with Eve's story. Eve, you say you saw me enter weapons from cafeteria at tick 13 and Charlie was already in there. But I actually saw YOU in weapons at tick 13, and then you left toward security right as I came in. Charlie was alive when I entered \u2014 and you were the last one in that room with him before me.\n\nAlice, I get why it looks suspicious. I walked in and there he was. If I had killed him, why would I just stand there waiting for you to walk in? That makes zero sense. I'd have bolted.\n\nEve's route is conveniently placing her \"passing through\" right at the murder scene, and now she's pointing at me to cover it. I think Eve is the duck. She had the same opportunity I did, plus she's the one trying hardest to bury me right now.\n\nFrank, Diana \u2014 please think carefully before voting. Eve was in weapons at tick 13 too."}}
{"timestamp": 1779396523.751518, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I was in electrical, then medbay, upper engine, and ended up in oxygen. \n\nI can actually confirm the first half of Bob's route \u2014 I saw him go from medbay to electrical around tick 4, and then back into medbay at tick 8. So he's telling the truth about his early game.\n\nHowever... Bob, did you really just say out loud, \"I was faking \u2014 I mean, I was checking on the weapons task panel\"? Geese do not fake tasks. That is a massive, incredibly suspicious slip-up. \n\nEven though your early route checks out with what I saw, your own words just gave you away. Add that to the fact that Alice caught you literally standing over Charlie's dead body, and I think we have our Duck. It's a he-said-she-said between you and Eve about tick 13, but the Freudian slip about faking a task makes it an easy choice for me. \n\nI'm voting Bob. Frank, let's hear what you saw to close this out, but I think the choice is pretty obvious."}}
{"timestamp": 1779396543.9775941, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I can definitely confirm the early game routes for both Alice and Eve. I saw Eve in upper engine around ticks 3 and 4, and then we were both in oxygen around tick 6. I also saw Alice in oxygen with me right after, from ticks 6 through 8. Their stories hold up completely on my end.\n\nBut honestly, we don't even need to overanalyze the pathing here. Bob, you literally just said out loud to all of us: \"I was faking \u2014 I mean, I was checking on the weapons task panel.\" \n\nInnocent Geese do not fake tasks. Period. \n\nAlice walked in on you standing right over Charlie's body, and your defense was to accidentally confess to faking tasks before trying to drag Eve down with you. Diana is absolutely right to point out that massive Freudian slip. It's a dead giveaway. You got caught red-handed and panicked. I'm voting for Bob, and everyone else should too so we can win this."}}
